  "description": "Product surface of the main window: core status, secrets status (booleans only), graph read (project-root scoped), project open, create (scaffolded like the Mac app), close, forget-recent (host-run folder dialog, no dialog/fs plugin permission), tray + host-built notifications from a fixed kind table (no notification plugin permission), terminal, open_external_url (validated, confirmed links), reveal_in_os (project-scoped), attach_* (host file picker, opaque handles), bypass_confirm and trust_confirm (native dialogs with fixed text), pick_folder (+ single-use redeem), get_prefs/set_prefs (strict typed host prefs), update_status/update_check/update_install (host-run signed updater; no updater plugin permission). No fs/shell/opener/http plugin, no wildcard permissions.",
